usage: benchmark_circle_optimizer.py [-h] [--repeat REPEAT] [--warmup WARMUP]
                                     [--maximum-steps MAXIMUM_STEPS]
                                     [--constant-folding-profile {basic,heavy}]
                                     [--resolve-legacy-custom-ops]
                                     [--legalize-dynamic-fully-connected]
                                     [--fuse-transpose-conv-slice]
                                     [--fuse-legacy-fc-gelu-fc] [--json]
                                     input

Benchmark O1 scheduling on one caller-provided full Circle artifact.

positional arguments:
  input                 Local full .circle artifact.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repeat REPEAT       Measured runs per scheduler (default: 3).
  --warmup WARMUP       Unmeasured runs per scheduler (default: 1).
  --maximum-steps MAXIMUM_STEPS
                        Maximum pass invocations per optimize phase.
  --constant-folding-profile {basic,heavy}
  --resolve-legacy-custom-ops
  --legalize-dynamic-fully-connected
  --fuse-transpose-conv-slice
  --fuse-legacy-fc-gelu-fc
  --json                Print one machine-readable JSON object.
